{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS1dFDCvx8EPnGcNJ9UZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the bug, added regression tests, and wrote the cause and fix up in `ANSWER.md`. The tests pass, and the new one fails on the old code with the same error as the production log.\n\n**Why it fails:** each story is stored with its three most similar stories and a score for each. That score was a Python `float`, and boto3 won't store floats in DynamoDB (`TypeError: Float types are not supported`). On the first publish the table is empty, so the list of similar stories is empty and there's no float to reject. That's why it worked once. Every publish after that fails, even when nothing overlaps, because a zero score is still `0.0`. The existing test only published one story into an empty table, so it never hit this.\n\n**Fix in `src/app.py`:**\n- **At the source:** the similarity function now returns an exact `Decimal` (for example `Decimal('0.4123')`) instead of a float.\n- **So it can't come back:** a new `to_dynamo()` step converts any float anywhere in the item to a `Decimal`, and every save goes through it. A float added later, from a new field or a client sending a number, can no longer cause a 500.\n\n**Tests in `tests/test_publish.py`:**\n- One test publishes three stories through the request handler. It checks that each returns 201 and that the stored scores are `Decimal`s in the right order.\n- A second test checks the float conversion on nested data.\n\nI only worked inside the repo, ran nothing against AWS, and haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":916,"cache_read_input_tokens":26288,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":916},"output_tokens":478,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6972ebfb-7a70-445b-b42e-6a506673d6d8","uuid":"d3fa2285-c0cc-4467-80d5-902ba3a7b53e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:13:01.494Z","request_id":"req_011CgS1dEtcBEB52TcY69jbR"}
